> > DM_DISABLE_OTHER_RULES_FLAG is set, because blkid will be skipped
> > in both cases. Also, if DM_UDEV_PRIMARY_SOURCE_FLAG is not set,
> > it makes no sense to try and import the properties.
> >=20
